      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To address your concerns, I suggest: \n\n- Always research the specific requirements for your airline and route to ensure you understand the \"airside\" vs \"landside\" rules. This can usually be found on the airline's website or in their catch-all FAQs section.\n- Check with your airline ahead of time to confirm your entry and exit procedures. Clearing customs from the gate may be an option for some airlines, but not all.\n- When checking in for your flights, inform the airline staff about your layovers and any travel arrangements you have made.\n- Arrive early for all flights, especially if you're carrying items that require further processing (e.g. customs declared items). \n- Ask your travel agency or local assistance for guidance on navigating the airport procedures, if your team is using a travel agency.",
